"""GraphAAV: graph-transformer regression on ESM per-residue embeddings.

Each capsid variant is turned into a sequence-local graph: nodes are residues
carrying per-residue protein-language-model embeddings, and edges connect
residues within a +/-3 position window with a 5-dimensional relative-position
feature. A TransformerConv encoder with edge updates and context gating
produces node states, which are pooled by global attention and mapped to a
scalar (tissue enrichment or production fitness) by an MLP head.

Usage:
    python src/graphaav.py --mode train --target_column production_fitness
    python src/graphaav.py --mode all --compare_representations
"""

